                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I nino maca, Rwot biketo can i kom Leviatan, ma en aye twol ma ŋeyo paŋŋe twatwal me laro kwone; Rwot biketo can i kome ki twon pala lucwanne matek, mabit mada, dok bineko min kulu ma bedo i nam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
